stream
BT
/F1 9 Tf
40 800 Td
11 TL
(to the digital loan, loan agreement, KFS, or conduct of the Lending Service Provider.) Tj
T*
(Absence of Grievance Officer contact information in the KFS is a direct violation of) Tj
T*
(RBI Digital Lending Guidelines and Fair Practices Code \(Page 6, Clause 2.5\).) Tj
T*
(Borrowers must be able to escalate unresolved complaints to the RBI Ombudsman.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(=============================================================================) Tj
T*
(SECTION B: FAIR PRACTICES CODE FOR NBFCs) Tj
T*
(=============================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Clause 3.1 - Transparency in Loan Terms) Tj
T*
(NBFCs must ensure full transparency in all loan terms communicated to borrowers.) Tj
T*
(All fees and charges must be disclosed in the sanction letter and KFS before loan disbursal.) Tj
T*
(No fee shall be collected without prior disclosure and consent of the borrower.) Tj
T*
(Hidden charges are a violation of the Fair Practices Code and these Digital Lending Guidelines.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Clause 3.2 - Recovery Practices) Tj
T*
(Recovery agents must follow RBI guidelines on fair debt collection practices.) Tj
T*
(Harassment of borrowers or their family members is strictly prohibited.) Tj
T*
(Digital lending apps must not access borrower contacts, photos, or media beyond) Tj
T*
(what is necessary for KYC and credit underwriting purposes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Clause 3.3 - Data Privacy and Consent) Tj
T*
(All data collected from borrowers must be with explicit informed consent.) Tj
T*
(Data must be stored within India as per applicable data localisation requirements.) Tj
T*
(Borrowers have the right to access, correct and delete their personal data.) Tj
T*
(NBFCs and LSPs must comply with the Digital Personal Data Protection Act 2023.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(=============================================================================) Tj
T*
(SECTION C: PENALTIES FOR NON-COMPLIANCE) Tj
T*
(=============================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Clause 4.1 - Regulatory Action) Tj
T*
(RBI may impose monetary penalties on NBFCs that fail to comply with these guidelines.) Tj
T*
(Penalties for non-compliance with KFS requirements may range from Rs. 1 lakh to Rs. 1 crore) Tj
T*
(depending on the severity and frequency of violations.) Tj
T*
(Repeated violations may result in suspension of the Certificate of Registration.) Tj
T*
(RBI reserves the right to direct NBFCs to refund fees collected in violation of these norms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Clause 4.2 - Implementation Timeline) Tj
T*
(All NBFCs and their LSPs must implement these Digital Lending Guidelines with immediate effect) Tj
T*
(from September 2, 2022.) Tj
T*
(NBFCs that commenced digital lending prior to this date must achieve compliance within 90 days.) Tj
T*
(RBI supervisory officers will verify KFS compliance during annual inspections.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(=============================================================================) Tj
T*
(END OF RBI DIGITAL LENDING GUIDELINES SUMMARY) Tj
T*
(Reserve Bank of India | www.rbi.org.in) Tj
T*
(=============================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
